# TBMC — Controlled Live OPC Data Integration and End-to-End SCADA Verification

**Commission ID:** TBMC-COM-06A  
**Project:** TmoGit/TBMC-Deploy  
**Organization:** Acropolis Engineers  
**Execution type:** Controlled configuration change and commissioning verification  
**Design baseline:** Existing FAT-approved Ignition application

## 1. Objective

Demonstrate end-to-end acquisition of live equipment data through the existing deployed Ignition equipment UDTs and FAT-approved SCADA application.

Transition selected simulated process measurement tags to verified live OPC UA data sources without changing the existing application structure, equipment hierarchy, alarm definitions, status logic or visualization configuration.

The existing UDTs and SCADA design shall remain authoritative.

This commission is not a UDT redesign, application refactoring or full equipment deployment exercise.

